       *> BENEFICI - record layout of BeneficialOwners (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY BENEFICI REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 544 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(129).
       *> Business (relationship, string)
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS PIC X(64).
       *> FullName (raw, string)
           15 :P:-FULL-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-FULL-NAME PIC X(64).
       *> DateOfBirthEncrypted (raw, string)
           15 :P:-DATE-OF-BIRTH-ENCRYPTE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-DATE-OF-BIRTH-ENCRYPTE PIC X(64).
       *> SsnEncrypted (raw, string)
           15 :P:-SSN-ENCRYPTED-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-SSN-ENCRYPTED PIC X(64).
       *> AddressEncrypted (raw, string)
           15 :P:-ADDRESS-ENCRYPTED-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-ADDRESS-ENCRYPTED PIC X(68).
       *> OwnershipPercentage (raw, float)
           15 :P:-OWNERSHIP-PERCENTAGE PIC S9(9)V9(2) COMP-3.
       *> IsControlPerson (raw, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-CONTROL-PERSON PIC X.
       *> BusinessLabel (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-BUSINESS-LABEL PIC X(64).
       *> Meets25PercentThreshold (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-MEETS25-PERCENT-THRESH-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-MEETS25-PERCENT-THRESH PIC X.
       *> MeetsCddThreshold (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-MEETS-CDD-THRESHOLD-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-MEETS-CDD-THRESHOLD PIC X.
